  "summary": "The Eiffel Tower is a 300 m iron lattice tower on the Champ de Mars in Paris, built by Gustave Eiffel's company from January 1887 to March 1889 for the Exposition Universelle. It was the tallest structure in the world until 1930 and became the emblem of Paris.",
